<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus 1996 subscriber base up 13 pct.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus 1996 subscriber base up 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French pay television firm Canal Plus said on Thursday its subscriber base expanded 13.0 percent in 1996 from with the end of 1995 to 8.21 million.</p>
<p>Canal Plus gave the following breakdown of subscriptions:</p>
<p>					end 96	end 95     pct change</p>
<p>    TOTAL			 8,214,982   7,271,026	 13.0</p>
<p>    France individuals	4,204,676   4,070,185	  3.3</p>
<p>    France collectives	  262,236     244,994	  7.0</p>
<p>    Canalsatellite France     446,106     305,878	 45.8</p>
<p>    Canalsatellite Spain	 98,691	41,623	137.1</p>
<p>    Belgium			 181,269     171,627	  5.6</p>
<p>    Spain			 1,366,063   1,204,615	 13.4</p>
<p>    Germany		     1,403,683   1,063,768	 31.9</p>
<p>    Africa			  119,110     115,444	  3.2</p>
<p>    Poland			  132,258	52,892	150.0</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
